# Operator overrides on the appropriation lines of one payment:
#  300 late (outside its discount term), operator pays o/s less the
#      deduction and answers N to the settle prompt
#  301 operator first enters more than is owed (Payment Too High),
#      then a zero (No change)
#  302 late, operator pays o/s less the deduction and answers Y
#  303 partial payment
#  304 proposal is the full o/s (only capped by the whole payment
#      value, not by what is left of it), so the operator types the
#      remainder
